# Items (validation 1): an item runs without a chain from the owner's main phase command, and
# what it does is a normal core action whose effects still happen afterwards: Fire Princess
# (a continuous effect) burns the opponent, and Aromage Jasmine's mandatory trigger starts a
# normal chain and draws. Items are consumables (decided 2026-10-07): 2 uses here.
start_draw 0 0
start_draw 1 0
lp 0 5000
item 0 990000303 x2         # 回復藥: gain 1000 LP, 2 uses
card 0 mzone 64752646       # Fire Princess: when you gain LP, 500 damage to the opponent
card 0 mzone 96789758       # Aromage Jasmine: when you gain LP, draw 1 (trigger, once per turn)
card 0 deck 15025844 x10
card 1 deck 15025844 x10

0 idle activate 990000303
expect item 990000303 success
expect lp 0 6000
expect lp 1 7500            # Fire Princess after the item
expect chain 96789758       # Jasmine's trigger resolved in its own chain
expect count 0 hand 1
expect uses 990000303 1
0 idle activate 990000303   # second use
expect lp 0 7000
expect lp 1 7000
expect uses 990000303 0
expect blocked activate 990000303
0 idle end
stop
